## English
Dear Parents,
The school will close for the mid-term break this Friday. Learners
will return on the Monday after the break at 8:00 a.m. Please make
sure all outstanding fees are paid before we resume. Thank you for
your continued support.

## Yorùbá
Ẹ̀yin òbí wa ọ̀wọ́n,
Ilé-ẹ̀kọ́ yóò lọ fún ìsinmi àárín sáà ní ọjọ́ Ẹtì yìí. Àwọn
akẹ́kọ̀ọ́ yóò padà sí ilé-ẹ̀kọ́ ní ọjọ́ Ajé tó tẹ̀lé ìsinmi náà, ní
aago mẹ́jọ òwúrọ̀. Ẹ jọ̀wọ́, ẹ rí i pé gbogbo owó ilé-ẹ̀kọ́ tó kù tí
ẹ kò tíì san ti wà ní sísan kí a tó padà. Ẹ ṣeun fún àtìlẹ́yìn yín.

## Translator's note
I used the plural, respectful "ẹ" throughout, since a school is
addressing parents. I translated "mid-term break" by meaning
(ìsinmi àárín sáà) because there is no fixed one-word equivalent.
